From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pinctrl: k230: add pin function definitions

Add the K230 IOMUX pin, function and pad configuration macros used by
the K230 device trees.

Upstream-Status: Pending
